Known-failure pin fragments: pins a package adds without editing scripts/checks-known-failures.tsv.

scripts/verify-run-manifest.py loads every scripts/checks-known-failures.d/*.tsv (lexical order) after the pin file,
with the same columns (header line required):

  step exit fail

Each step must be a known-failure row of the manifest or a manifest fragment. A step's pins live in one file: a step
pinned in two files is FAIL.
